##########################################################################
# PowerShellModule-RepositoryMonitors.otter
#
# Purpose : Define BuildMaster Repository Monitors that trigger the
#           PowerShellModule-5Stage plan when branches are pushed in the
#           ATAP.Utilities GitHub repository.
#
# Immutable build note:
#   Under the immutable build strategy, only sprint-branch and main pushes
#   trigger pipeline runs. Tier promotion happens via BuildMaster pipeline
#   stage progression and `Promote-ProGetPackage` API calls, not branch
#   pushes to integration/qa/release branches.
#
# How to apply:
#   1. In the BuildMaster UI, open the application for ATAP.Utilities.
#   2. Navigate to Settings → Repository Monitors.
#   3. Create one monitor per entry below (or use the BuildMaster API
#      with the /api/resource-monitors endpoint).
#   4. Confirm each monitor by performing a test push to the target branch.
#
# Tier resolution:
#   NBGV prerelease label → Tier → Feed
#   -Sprint-  → Experimental  → powershellget-experimental
#   -Alpha-   → Development   → powershellget-development
#   -Beta-    → Integration   → powershellget-integration
#   -QA-      → QA            → powershellget-qa
#   (none)    → Production    → powershellget-stable
#
# Path filter:
#   PathFilter: src/** ensures that commits touching ONLY
#   SolutionDocumentation/ or README.md do not trigger a build.
#
# Webhook secret:
#   WebhookSecret references env var BUILDMASTER_GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET.
#   PREREQUISITE: Create a Bitwarden secure-note named
#     "BUILDMASTER_GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET" and add it to LoginScript.ps1 so
#     the env var is populated before BuildMaster starts.
#
# Variables used by triggered builds:
#   $Branch          — the branch that triggered the monitor (injected by BM)
#   $ApplicationName — set as Application Variable: "ATAP.Utilities"
#   $SourcePath      — set as Application Variable: working-directory path
#   $Modules         — set as Application Variable: list of PS module names
##########################################################################

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Monitor 1 — main branch (Production)
# Triggers  : any push to "main"
# Stage     : Production (NBGV resolves from absent prerelease label)
# PathFilter: src/** — docs-only commits do not trigger a build
# Interval  : poll every 10 minutes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GitHub::Repository-Monitor PowerShellModules-Main-Monitor
(
    Organization: BillHertzing,
    Repository: ATAP.Utilities,
    BranchFilter: main,
    PathFilter: src/**,
    PollInterval: 600,
    WebhookSecret: $EnvironmentVariable(BUILDMASTER_GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET),
    PipelineName: PowerShellModule-5Stage,
    BuildVariables: %(Branch: $Branch)
);

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Monitor 2 — Sprint branches (Experimental)
# Triggers  : any push to a branch matching *-Sprint-*-work-items
# Stage     : Experimental (NBGV resolves from -Sprint- prerelease label)
# PathFilter: src/** — docs-only commits do not trigger a build
# Interval  : poll every 2 minutes
# Note      : pushes to the shared permanent powershellget-experimental feed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GitHub::Repository-Monitor PowerShellModules-Sprint-Monitor
(
    Organization: BillHertzing,
    Repository: ATAP.Utilities,
    BranchFilter: *-Sprint-*-work-items,
    PathFilter: src/**,
    PollInterval: 120,
    WebhookSecret: $EnvironmentVariable(BUILDMASTER_GH_WEBHOOK_SECRET),
    PipelineName: PowerShellModule-5Stage,
    BuildVariables: %(Branch: $Branch)
);
